  "deeLab": {
    "en": "<section class=\"dee-lab section\" id=\"dee-lab\" aria-labelledby=\"dee-lab-title\" data-dee-step=\"2\"><div class=\"dee-lab-intro\"><div><p class=\"dee-intro-line\">Meet DEE. A little D with a point of view.</p><h2 id=\"dee-lab-title\">Small fixes.<br/>A clearer story.</h2></div><div class=\"dee-lab-lead\"><p>Watch DEE turn a confusing florist homepage into a clear offer. Three small decisions. One useful difference.</p><div class=\"dee-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Explore DEE’s three design steps\"><button id=\"dee-step-0\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"dee-lab-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" disabled=\"\"><span>Spot it</span></button><button id=\"dee-step-1\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"dee-lab-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" disabled=\"\"><span>Fix it</span></button><button id=\"dee-step-2\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"dee-lab-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><span class=\"dee-tab-active\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Make your mark</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"dee-lab-stage\" id=\"dee-lab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"dee-step-2\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"dee-companion\"><div class=\"dee-character-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"dee-character\" src=\"/assets/dee/dee-curious.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:none\"/><img class=\"dee-character\" src=\"/assets/dee/dee-pointing.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"/></div><div class=\"dee-comment\"><h3>One clear offer. One obvious next step.</h3><p>The headline, image and button now tell the same story. That is the idea behind the work.</p></div></div><div class=\"dee-browser\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Fictional florist homepage preview\"><div class=\"dee-browser-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><i>example / florist</i></div><div class=\"dee-florist-nav\"><span>Example florist</span><span>Beirut</span></div><div class=\"dee-preview dee-preview-after\"><div class=\"dee-preview-copy\"><h3 style=\"transform:none\">Same-day flowers in Beirut.</h3><p>Seasonal bouquets for the moments that matter.</p><div class=\"dee-preview-actions\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Visual examples of webpage actions\"><span class=\"dee-example-primary\">Order flowers<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></div><p class=\"dee-example-hint\">Choose your bouquet. Make someone’s day.</p></div><div class=\"dee-preview-art\"><svg class=\"dee-flowers\" viewBox=\"0 0 260 290\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M130 272V88M130 236L72 139M130 220L193 118\" stroke=\"#445848\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M129 212C86 222 74 191 80 170C114 174 132 190 129 212ZM132 247C178 244 195 215 188 193C152 204 133 221 132 247Z\" fill=\"#647D62\"></path><g transform=\"translate(130 67) scale(1)\"><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(0)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(60)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(120)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(180)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(240)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(300)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><circle r=\"14\" fill=\"#6B4939\"></circle><circle r=\"7\" fill=\"#D4A35F\"></circle></g><g transform=\"translate(64 126) scale(0.79)\"><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(0)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(60)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(120)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(180)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(240)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(300)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><circle r=\"14\" fill=\"#6B4939\"></circle><circle r=\"7\" fill=\"#D4A35F\"></circle></g><g transform=\"translate(198 105) scale(0.85)\"><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(0)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(60)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(120)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(180)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(240)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(300)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><circle r=\"14\" fill=\"#6B4939\"></circle><circle r=\"7\" fill=\"#D4A35F\"></circle></g></svg></div></div></div></div><p class=\"dee-progress sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">After: a clear offer and one next step.</p><div class=\"dee-lab-footer\"><p>Fictional business. Visual demonstration of design choices, not client results.</p><a class=\"dee-contact\" href=\"#contact\">Let’s make your website clearer<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section>",
    "ar": "<section class=\"dee-lab section\" id=\"dee-lab\" aria-labelledby=\"dee-lab-title\" data-dee-step=\"2\"><div class=\"dee-lab-intro\"><div><p class=\"dee-intro-line\">تعرّف إلى DEE. حرف صغير، ونظرة مختلفة.</p><h2 id=\"dee-lab-title\">تعديلات صغيرة.<br/>رسالة أوضح.</h2></div><div class=\"dee-lab-lead\"><p>شاهد كيف يحوّل DEE صفحة زهور مربكة إلى عرض واضح. ثلاثة قرارات بسيطة تصنع فرقاً مفيداً.</p><div class=\"dee-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"استكشف خطوات التصميم الثلاث مع DEE\"><button id=\"dee-step-0\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"dee-lab-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" disabled=\"\"><span>نلاحظ</span></button><button id=\"dee-step-1\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"dee-lab-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" disabled=\"\"><span>نعدّل</span></button><button id=\"dee-step-2\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"dee-lab-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><span class=\"dee-tab-active\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>نترك بصمة</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"dee-lab-stage\" id=\"dee-lab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"dee-step-2\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"dee-companion\"><div class=\"dee-character-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"dee-character\" src=\"/assets/dee/dee-curious.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:none\"/><img class=\"dee-character\" src=\"/assets/dee/dee-pointing.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"/></div><div class=\"dee-comment\"><h3>عرض واضح. وخطوة تالية يعرفها الجميع.</h3><p>العنوان والصورة والزر تروي القصة نفسها. هذه هي الفكرة وراء العمل.</p></div></div><div class=\"dee-browser\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"معاينة توضيحية لصفحة محل زهور خيالي\"><div class=\"dee-browser-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><i>example / florist</i></div><div class=\"dee-florist-nav\"><span>محل زهور تجريبي</span><span>بيروت</span></div><div class=\"dee-preview dee-preview-after\"><div class=\"dee-preview-copy\"><h3 style=\"transform:none\">زهور تصلك اليوم في بيروت.</h3><p>باقات موسمية للحظات التي تستحق أن نحتفل بها.</p><div class=\"dee-preview-actions\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"أمثلة بصرية لأزرار الصفحة\"><span class=\"dee-example-primary\">اطلب الزهور<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></div><p class=\"dee-example-hint\">اختر باقتك. وأسعد شخصاً تحبّه.</p></div><div class=\"dee-preview-art\"><svg class=\"dee-flowers\" viewBox=\"0 0 260 290\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M130 272V88M130 236L72 139M130 220L193 118\" stroke=\"#445848\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M129 212C86 222 74 191 80 170C114 174 132 190 129 212ZM132 247C178 244 195 215 188 193C152 204 133 221 132 247Z\" fill=\"#647D62\"></path><g transform=\"translate(130 67) scale(1)\"><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(0)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(60)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(120)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(180)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(240)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(300)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><circle r=\"14\" fill=\"#6B4939\"></circle><circle r=\"7\" fill=\"#D4A35F\"></circle></g><g transform=\"translate(64 126) scale(0.79)\"><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(0)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(60)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(120)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(180)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(240)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(300)\" fill=\"#D8AC9E\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><circle r=\"14\" fill=\"#6B4939\"></circle><circle r=\"7\" fill=\"#D4A35F\"></circle></g><g transform=\"translate(198 105) scale(0.85)\"><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(0)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(60)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(120)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(180)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(240)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><ellipse cy=\"-22\" rx=\"19\" ry=\"29\" transform=\"rotate(300)\" fill=\"#E7C7B2\" stroke=\"#BD8A78\" stroke-width=\".8\"></ellipse><circle r=\"14\" fill=\"#6B4939\"></circle><circle r=\"7\" fill=\"#D4A35F\"></circle></g></svg></div></div></div></div><p class=\"dee-progress sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">بعد التعديل: عرض واضح وخطوة تالية واحدة.</p><div class=\"dee-lab-footer\"><p>شركة خيالية. عرض توضيحي لقرارات التصميم، وليس نتائج عميل حقيقي.</p><a class=\"dee-contact\" href=\"#contact\">لنجعل موقعك أوضح<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section>"
